                    "text_CWxHTE": {
                      "type": "text",
                      "name": "t:names.text",
                      "settings": {
                        "text": "<p>We try our best to ship orders out the following day, however, we are a small business with a small team, so please allow <strong>1-3 business days for order processing</strong>.</p><p>Orders are shipped out daily, Monday - Friday (excluding holidays and inclement weather days), in the order they are received; shipping times may vary based on destination, weather, chosen delivery method, etc.</p>",
